<section id="how-it-works" class="page-section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="how-title" class="type-h2">How it works</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Three steps. You add the show, the agent does a sponsorship team's research, you pitch.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3 class="type-h3">Add your show</h3>
        <p>Search for it by name. If you like, add your downloads and a few shows your listeners also love. Nothing else is required.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3 class="type-h3">Watch the agent research</h3>
        <p>
          In about two minutes it reads your recent episodes, finds comparable shows on Qloo, maps what your listeners'
          tastes over-index on and checks who sponsors similar shows. Every step is on screen.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3 class="type-h3">Pitch the brands that fit</h3>
        <p>
          Matches arrive ranked, each with a fit score, a plain reason and the evidence. One click writes the pitch email,
          ad-read ideas and a price from your rate card.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
